# Third-Party Notices

This file lists third-party code and specifications referenced by
core-fm1's WiFi subsystem (`firmware/src/wifi/`), with their licenses
and copyright holders. See `docs/hardware/wifi/CLEAN_ROOM_METHODOLOGY.md` for the
clean-room methodology.


## Ralink RT2x00 WiFi Driver

The WiFi MAC layer and STA state machine architecture are informed by
the Ralink RT2x00 driver family in the Linux kernel. High-level
architectural patterns (state machine structure, frame dispatch flow)
were referenced, and register offsets, bit definitions and initial
values from `rt2800.h` / `rt2800lib.c` are used with line citations in
the code (GPL-2.0-or-later is compatible with GPL-3.0); no driver logic
was copied or directly translated.

- Source: `drivers/net/wireless/ralink/rt2x00/` (Linux kernel)
- License: GPL-2.0-or-later
- Copyright: Copyright (C) 2004-2010 Ivo van Doorn <IvDoorn@gmail.com>
             and contributors
- Files influenced: `firmware/src/wifi/wifi_mac.c`,
  `firmware/src/wifi/wifi_sta.c`


