## System Library Exception

This firmware links at build time against JieLi's AC79 SDK runtime
libraries (clock init, flash access, interrupt vectors, DMA setup).
Under GPL-3.0 section 1, these qualify as "System Libraries" of the
target platform: they are distributed with the major components of
the operating environment (the AC791N SoC's firmware toolchain), are
not derived from this Program, and serve only to enable use of the
Program on the target hardware. The Corresponding Source of this
firmware therefore does not include the JieLi SDK runtime, consistent
with the GPL-3.0 System Library exception.

The JieLi AC79 SDK's published application sources and headers are
Apache-2.0 (see the JieLi entry above). The SDK's pre-compiled static
libraries (.a) are platform runtime components, not combined works, and
are covered by the exception above.
